  m_Text: is an exciting arcade game where the player must control the ball, jumping
    over obstacles and collecting stars along the way. To move forward, the player
    must tap the screen to make the ball jump, avoiding various obstacles such as
    pits, walls and obstacles. The goal of the game is to go as far as possible,
    collecting as many stars as possible and setting new records. Use your reaction
    and agility to successfully maneuver through the levels and achieve high scores.
    Are you ready to take on this challenge and become the best in "Jump for the
    Stars"?
